# Upper small even maximal-subgroup certificate rows

Short generating families, Schreier word equalities and finite transition
bounds certify the original node and edge numbering. The witness generator
uses historical diagnostic data only for selection; `decide +kernel` checks
every equation against the actual group arithmetic.

Source: Shinoda (1975), (2.3), pp. 81–82, and the root-word conventions and
input provenance in `SmallEvenDescentEdgeData`.
-/

